cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Second Opinion: a verifier for the arithmetic of published meta-analyses"
abstract: >-
  An open harness that re-derives the quantitative claims of published diagnostic
  meta-analyses and reports disagreement with a source line. Reproduces 137/137 published
  pooled specificity estimates and 136/137 sensitivity estimates within 0.01.
authors:
